[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27011.35, "timestamp": "07:30:11", "text": "？以一種羨慕"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27021.788, "timestamp": "07:30:21", "text": "或不情願的方式。效果出奇的好。人的面做會更容易些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27025.27, "timestamp": "07:30:25", "text": "很難，但我希望你們都能對現在的情況有所了解。至於力道感到驚訝了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27044.07, "timestamp": "07:30:44", "text": "星期一是重要的日子。是的。 [uri就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27049.51, "timestamp": "07:30:49", "text": "個小果凍。 Siri，抱歉我剛才走神了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27051.51, "timestamp": "07:30:51", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27053.27, "timestamp": "07:30:53", "text": "不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27057.83, "timestamp": "07:30:57", "text": "哦，不。"}]